1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,445
W: Hello.

2
00:00:01,005 --> 00:00:03,405
This is Carol Dunning from Huntington Consulting.

3
00:00:04,165 --> 00:00:07,105
I need to talk to someone about the order we placed this morning.

4
00:00:08,545 --> 00:00:09,625
M: Good afternoon, Ms. Dunning.

5
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:10,845
I can handle that.

6
00:00:11,565 --> 00:00:12,925
Do you want to add something to your order?

7
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:14,025
W: That's correct.

8
00:00:14,765 --> 00:00:18,245
Would it be possible to double the amount of copy paper we ordered?

9
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,105
M: Totally.

10
00:00:19,885 --> 00:00:21,845
Should I send you an updated bill by e-mail?

11
00:00:22,205 --> 00:00:23,305
W: That won't be necessary.

12
00:00:23,805 --> 00:00:26,720
Just attach it to the invoice you send us every month.

13
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,145
M: Okay, I can do that.

14
00:00:29,865 --> 00:00:32,620
You can expect to receive everything by Friday morning.
